Internships are an indispensable stepping stone for CSE students to gain hands-on experience and enhance their resume. 
Quality internships should be found by keeping track of renowned institutes like IITs, IIITs, NITs, and organizations like CSIR and DRDO. 
State-level universities, such as Calcutta University (CU) and Jadavpur University (JU), also provide high-quality internship opportunities. Visit their official websites frequently in search of announcements. 
In addition to universities, LinkedIn and Unstop are great sources of finding domain-specific internships. Look out for openings and follow companies and industry people for network expansion. 
Never be afraid to ask these professionals about internship opportunities in their organizations, as networking always leads to hidden opportunities. Further, always keep track of the internships offered by top companies, as these often become PPOs. 
Being proactive and strategic ensures that you grab the internship opportunities that act as good career foundations.
